# The program of protocols/for-await.ir where a value may hold one layout or callee: every set that holds more is given up, so the untracked object arrives wherever a rule expects a built-in, a closure or a container.
# The solve ends with a result all the same, and the program with the results applied is valid
# OPTIONS: limit=MaxValueFlowSetMembers:1
# STATISTIC: MaxValueFlowSetMembersHits >= 1
# RUN: valueflow-solve
# CHECK: functions
# RUN(APPLY): valueflow-apply
# APPLY: function f0
# PROGRAM-OF: ../protocols/for-await.ir
